  "bodyHash": "ybVX2z5Wlq0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/09cff6f630c85bb6a70ca98e16a905d102c2a8d3.png\" alt=\"微命令\"></p><p><strong>通过精简版Minecraft命令，完成各种任务将更加快速。</strong>例如，你不再需要输入 <strong>/time set day</strong>，这个操作将被命令 <strong>/day</strong> 取代。</p><pre><code>注意：这是一个客户端模组。你无需在服务器上安装即可使用。</code></pre><hr><h2>🕒 时间与天气</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>微命令</th>\n<th>标准命令</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/day</strong></td>\n<td>/time set day</td>\n<td>将时间设置为白天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/night</strong></td>\n<td>/time set night</td>\n<td>将时间设置为夜晚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/noon</strong></td>\n<td>/time set noon</td>\n<td>将时间设置为正午</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/midnight</strong></td>\n<td>/time set midnight</td>\n<td>将时间设置为午夜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/sun</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr clear</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr c</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/rain</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr rain</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr r</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/thunder</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr thunder</strong></td>\n<td><strong>/wtr t</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>🎮 游戏模式与数据</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">微命令</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">标准命令</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/gm 0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/gamemode survival</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将游戏模式设为生存模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/gm 1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/gamemode creative</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将游戏模式设为创造模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/gm 2</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/gamemode adventure</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将游戏模式设为冒险模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/gm 3</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/gamemode spectator</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将游戏模式设为旁观模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/diff p</strong> | <strong>/diff peaceful</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/difficulty peaceful</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将难度设为和平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/diff e</strong> | <strong>/diff easy</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/difficulty easy</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将难度设为简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/diff n</strong> | <strong>/diff normal</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/difficulty normal</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将难度设为普通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/diff h</strong> | <strong>/diff hard</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/difficulty hard</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将难度设为困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/sp</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/spawnpoint</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">设置出生点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/heal</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/effect give <a href=\"https://github.com/s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@s</a> instant_health</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">治疗玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/feed</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/effect give <a href=\"https://github.com/s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@s</a> saturation</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">喂养玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/nv</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/effect give <a href=\"https://github.com/s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@s</a> night_vision</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">无限夜视</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/eclear</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/effect clear <a href=\"https://github.com/s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@s</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">清除所有效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>/tphere [玩家]</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">/tp [玩家] <a href=\"https://github.com/s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@s</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">将玩家传送至你身边</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><h2>⚙️ 游戏规则快捷命令</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>微命令</th>\n<th>标准命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr keepinv [t/f]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule keep_inventory [true/false]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr day [t/f]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule advance_time [true/false]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr wtr [t/f]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule advance_weather [true/false]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr pvp [t/f]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule pvp [true/false]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr grief [t/f]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule mob_griefing [true/false]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>/gr rts [数字]</strong></td>\n<td>/gamerule random_tick_speed [数字]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinycommands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/57rNyyy/image.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftinycommands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TqwWmF06/1.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>",
